{"job_id":"F-58253c9f482d36e9d29d","family_id":"F-58253c9f482d36e9d29d","title":"관광기본법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":5,"target_id":"22376232e920737a970076276861a7a34172e47a0587d71b00ece18c0629f40e","source_hash":"7d18836a9fd218ec5a0f2d39ed7c042b91c81d6c7d176b181a0a2355f44e628f","text":"旅游框架法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":124,"target_id":"38d529ed2e550aa6820d60021cdf81e4a11844a0685e1ffeb309b22416d8af49","source_hash":"f442ea0f855dfc67d4dc870648e919ae1150cf269505187222a24c8ac4db198b","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是通过规定旅游促进的方向和政策，促进国际友谊，改善国民经济和公共福利，并促进国内旅游业的健康可持续发展。<2024年1月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":124,"end":193,"target_id":"78244cab723d11dc8c9abcfe44ab7e9a329467eff6836ff9cbde8e5a3e8ab7e5","source_hash":"a4f078df60b058c266cf75bd0f7617a6bd4156f7354794a1ca4899aea73bb649","text":"第二条（政府措施）政府应当制定促进旅游业发展的基本和综合措施，以实现本法的目的。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":193,"end":261,"target_id":"b09bb9f4105bfbf0933303f030c2ea2a0126ce3e514b52684d6022067d8d795e","source_hash":"4db26a236c2a35501a4e959448c93428c15ee6d71451921d151b7833788f66ac","text":"第 2-2 条（与其他法律的关系）制定或修改有关旅游的其他法律时，应当符合本法的目的。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":261,"end":943,"target_id":"f1b349622b8d3580776b9f8db0d1ede91f4b61ef54a2b16fd7da28eaaadd7956","source_hash":"19237c4bc389423cf9af88486836cd61637842624d09c0e2585347c345b48fd9","text":"第三条（制定旅游促进计划）\n① 政府应每五年制定并实施旅游促进基本计划（以下简称“基本计划”），为发展旅游奠定基础，增强旅游业竞争力。\n② 基本计划应包括以下事项：<2020年12月22日、2024年1月23日、2025年4月8日修订>\n1. 旅游促进政策基本方向\n1-2. 关于旅游业可持续发展的事项\n2. 国内外旅游状况及旅游趋势相关事宜\n3. 关于建立旅游促进基础设施的事项\n3-2. 根据《旅游促进法》第2条第13款，关于为旅游弱势群体等创造和支持无障碍旅游环境的事项\n4. 关于促进旅游业发展的行业政策事项\n5. 关于旅游推广财政资源的获取和分配事宜\n6. 关于旅游促进系统改进的事项\n6-2. 关于设立改善旅游从业人员工作环境基金会的事项，例如旅游业劳动力培训和工作条件调查\n7. 关于旅游促进相关中央行政机构间角色划分的事项\n8. 旅游设施中有关传染病等安全、卫生和疾病控制管理的事项\n9. 其他促进旅游业发展的必要事项\n③ 基本计划应当按照第十六条第一款的规定，经国家旅游战略会议审议后最终确定。\n④ 政府应当按照基本计划制定和实施年度实施计划，评估绩效结果，并将其反映在基本计划中。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":943,"end":1015,"target_id":"0b1b78687a7738601e7872be1b899cd82c75a898d1f506e4edcd36bb29cf4677","source_hash":"cc0afd257a66eb77a3a54ffa8cc75699e268d08c8ad312f6e28d550fba56fbc6","text":"第四条（年度报告）政府应在国会例会开始前向国会提交有关旅游促进政策和趋势的年度报告。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1015,"end":1095,"target_id":"122415d4b51e7aec0b6479f85cb2916e2bff8f108c75161d5b7edc86a152e567","source_hash":"efcf9b60e88cfafe74272e1becececdf17859535f3e07e5293dbd74aa4715b73","text":"第五条（法律措施）国家应当采取法律、财政措施以及其他必要的行政措施，以实施第二条规定的措施。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1095,"end":1151,"target_id":"2a14b57072c330999a2aa1949e85d09c23992d6a091d810a7f1a425933275937","source_hash":"94575dba4506d0a84f75775ebffe1e5fe6804c4239825be407cf82decb2e10f1","text":"第六条（地方政府的合作）地方政府应当制定国家旅游政策所必需的措施。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1151,"end":1241,"target_id":"7dfa2780ffcbba883147e372e5f8d1fd3add50860e808a3f5ea68c0ff6a5c6c6","source_hash":"29931bb79f4c530988d4368143584dd77305a51ecf17cc4555c4aaabc7974f0f","text":"第七条（吸引外国游客）政府应当加强海外宣传，完善移民程序，并采取其他必要措施，以促进吸引外国游客。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1241,"end":1360,"target_id":"0163a5b20c3cd3d07d4adca5617416f5415484816ef013cb859fc93449e7dcc7","source_hash":"6fe451ae302897bf02293979d053a65c41b5411b1a1ae081e597409b2387a93d","text":"第八条（创造旅游条件）政府应当制定必要措施，创造旅游条件，包括改善和扩建游客使用的住宿、交通和休息设施，以及完善节假日制度。<2018年12月24日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1360,"end":1488,"target_id":"8855875e32339a5b35c32e32fdc6dd19459f57f94579648ed88770331daf5808","source_hash":"1281b3efc2e999894eb41d39867d74141fbd15c0b08932e513149b00b0e6c919","text":"第九条（促进可持续旅游政策）政府应当促进可持续旅游的必要政策，充分考虑当前和未来的经济、社会和环境影响，例如旅游资源的保护、环境友好型开发和利用、创造就业机会和区域经济发展。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1488,"end":1563,"target_id":"2646419cd51e313bb541b0c10da7f8316ac59e3a49b752a014c6c47a7555f528","source_hash":"10218dd3d28988466fb54858efb1c9b72c606854e8afa27e7a961250ef6920ef","text":"第十条（旅游事业的指导和促进）政府应当指导和监督旅游事业，并制定其他必要措施以促进旅游事业的发展。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1563,"end":1643,"target_id":"513d59a6894bab6d51596683655c87a0d6d73eaf39cf6c1372e4398ffbffebe1","source_hash":"33d8789ae00bdb0df9b999c099d93345732744fa939ac7651b3c6942d18a6bac","text":"第11条（提高旅游从业人员素质）政府应当制定教育、培训和其他必要措施，以提高从事旅游业人员的素质。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1643,"end":1705,"target_id":"52d6aad86b31e95fcf57902343bdd471db680f2557cb3321ac93bf81248a4a0e","source_hash":"1197e583d0897c5c59854fb1e82378d1a29fb4f10d2211f1c912f78858933152","text":"第十二条（旅游景点的指定和开发）政府应当指定适宜旅游的地区为旅游景点，并进行必要的开发。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1705,"end":1782,"target_id":"0a808546beb9d309335ba73d02b8f3f8114c9437d714836bbd58d6607567a256","source_hash":"79638dc00accee6335f69c487c84bd1b04c9a323c223acb18d9425f164b24158","text":"第十三条（发展国内旅游业）政府应当采取必要措施，增进公众对旅游业的了解，发展健全的国内旅游业。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1782,"end":1832,"target_id":"d517281478dd11081df0c2fd39b06f871559c788a5f2a4b49daa810a3da7f560","source_hash":"24ae7ee0497a00c8a71ffbc78a694f303da9a358440812cd0d919fad9bfb44e3","text":"第十四条（旅游促进发展基金）政府设立旅游促进发展基金，以促进旅游业发展。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1832,"end":1853,"target_id":"29acb7b0e88f3b05721f2975ab0b0e22807d3c42708556743ad3932b0ce84404","source_hash":"f6008a83a1265201c94b2f1d98b864d0dac5aab12f3859015863aebc497440a5","text":"第 15 条已删除 <2000.1.12>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1853,"end":1999,"target_id":"1f6abeb8238ce13ecb10df942ed1457a3054bd5f53efed3f3437d3e58e529bbc","source_hash":"24d0bdf3a512b7e37d0de2c402dddeaa65419e85b75498e8264284d8cbf4c0f1","text":"第十六条（国家旅游战略会议）\n① 在总理领导下成立国家旅游战略委员会，负责审议和协调有关旅游促进方向和重大政策的制定和协调以及旅游促进计划的制定等事宜。\n② 国家旅游战略会议的组成、运作等事项，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1999,"end":2044,"target_id":"f7434b359dbdfd77511c73d665f70e02b9b884b0f99915c911adbdc0cd3ed2f5","source_hash":"9c3607cf4c0e9b39a5ff7ba7a8f842f9e24dd5a6b391ab8c6fcc11712d57cad8","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 2877，1975 年 12 月 31 日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2044,"end":2087,"target_id":"457cd5236ca8bb9e3355a1851bb54315734980eb21c5e9d3414f3f84707de4d0","source_hash":"09c3ea737c1af8143fe128436f7234d1b6aee463e2d381e89e2ad87cc469f337","text":"补充规定 <第6129号，2000年1月12日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2087,"end":2131,"target_id":"449bd4623bb6134b19508f39da0a0606a22119615033a4a7763b76b80a0fcae6","source_hash":"d996c2d90166ea6cd4c57fbb4ad0a5732aa2e63ad841bc56d311d39fde01a7b2","text":"补充规定 <第8741号，2007年12月21日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2131,"end":2186,"target_id":"336ff9be85cb471b9ad5a6b1af1b928716a685788f6a86de69da32f30a5dd04a","source_hash":"aa81981f4dfe9f2b70bf819ca4b4516a7258ed0e2ef19f4c461aee03eaf1ef28","text":"补充规定 <第15056号，2017年11月28日>\n\n本法自公布之日起一个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2186,"end":2231,"target_id":"0fed84f56980f517107793016fc4e2da370bf3bd3e51412c87cc664c5a50e1a1","source_hash":"b5bd2c0f3c41e86f01352dbb9f3ebf66da77101064c269f2dc107b21e80deb56","text":"补充规定 <第16049号，2018年12月24日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2231,"end":2286,"target_id":"56a2490b0b130836d77c834ea1e9f541ccf66861d3227587688b551930ffbdd9","source_hash":"c31d2471aeea608004b0013340b987406e02d1b60e9382726a1cc699c216a76f","text":"补充规定 <第17703号，2020年12月22日>\n\n本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2286,"end":2310,"target_id":"c2928984ca9ce501319b65606aa3c3e4e71735c99c678ba87ef2abf1e8a3b8b7","source_hash":"adf17e08dc49156dd7e0b0ce090103a9c5a44ebe868645908f2810c665d58389","text":"补充条款 <第20075号，2024年1月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2310,"end":2349,"target_id":"f354811702f7ebe48b9ea8f65bd81f9420165aa14a24b4c63827c7b3f2c94025","source_hash":"25ab8090219c7238abfcb9c5def1d259d4a6ffcd42cc55b280b8993c845bc68c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2349,"end":2417,"target_id":"0449f403b4d2c598556496f7295981a3240734cfcdee6e3799117dd9986a0cf5","source_hash":"942cd1a6193d352e86c484369a7ad3d583ff2aa1c003d05e272375b359523d6e","text":"第二条（适用于基本计划）第三条第二款的修正规定，自本法实施后基本计划制定和实施之日起适用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2417,"end":2440,"target_id":"c2619442d3f5d06242a78296db316e89ba65627f8cb89d016f8bdc4447e20efc","source_hash":"87ea50bf398d7eb04433b1ef5750e6d94a066add7e0a6bb65684bb1e4335a7a1","text":"补充规定 <第20910号，2025年4月8日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2440,"end":2479,"target_id":"5828f310b7d372d68b4d6c74eb502b00319ff193288276a365e38d3affba9a2f","source_hash":"25ab8090219c7238abfcb9c5def1d259d4a6ffcd42cc55b280b8993c845bc68c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000086-270599-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2479,"end":2541,"target_id":"3bccab61901e835ceb2111d3d92b825ef4587a06b6580f2c87b8034d7dbbd83f","source_hash":"3746df5c5c72475706b9126e1bb3daead2bb09560e901deb79f4802461c0a4ec","text":"第二条（适用于旅游促进计划的制定）本法自本法实施后制定旅游促进计划之日起适用。"}]}